# One Claude Code tool pattern per line — see `claude --help` for the syntax.
# Edit(pattern) covers all file-editing tools (Write included). There is no
# pattern meaning "only .legion" — deny rules can't express "everything
# except X", only concrete matches. Replace these with wherever this repo's
# actual source lives; a planner should be editing mission/plan files, not code.
Edit(src/**)
Edit(**/*.py)
Edit(**/*.js)
Edit(**/*.ts)
